  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-rc1 freezes the intended Icod.Terminal 1.x contract. The release candidate adds no new terminal protocol family; it consolidates permanent architecture, ownership, lifecycle, input/query, presentation/output, security, compatibility, and migration documentation; machine-freezes the exported public API and enum values across net8.0/net9.0/net10.0; and adds fresh package/downstream release-candidate validation. One intentional pre-1.0 API correction removes the public TerminalSession.Input raw-reader property so a live session retains one authoritative input/query-routing path; ITerminalInput remains public for custom transport injection and TerminalSession.Output remains the documented advanced borrowed output transport. Existing semantic protocol APIs and historical 0.8-0.18 package contracts remain retained.",
